    <string name="reset_title">Delete the whole Ubuntu system?</string>
    <string name="reset_body">Every session is closed and the Ubuntu system, with all its files, users and packages, is deleted. Your phone\'s data in /sdcard and /data is not touched: everything is unmounted first, and the deletion is refused while anything is still mounted. Type %1$s to confirm.</string>
